// R4g-composer CP4 (X7-10, ledger composer-01 / composer-12): the Code card's staged attachments are the 2.42304.0 tiles
// and paste / drop / the picker share the original route.
//  - shared-2 Hp's Image / File / Quote tiles (wp / Pp / Bp) and c0fbbe82d's wrappers hr / _r / vr / mr / pr, generated by
//    scripts/extract-code-composer.mjs (chat-composer-attachments.mjs, composer-attachment-tiles.mjs), laid out by
//    src/source-composer-tiles.jsx as c0fbbe82d Ri's row inside uM's shelf;
//  - cc43287c9 aK over shared-52 mb (composer-intake-route.mjs / composer-intake-split.mjs), wired in source-composer.jsx.
// The official strings are counted in the shipped minified chunks (split().length - 1); markup is SSR; the presses run
// under a minimal hook dispatcher with fake frames. Nothing opens a window.
